OQ5rR86m6PyM","number":1,"title":"Fix three code bugs","user":{"login":"anuragg-saxenaa","id":17893081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODkzMDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17893081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa","html_url":"https://github.com/anuragg-saxenaa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-04T17:43:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T19:38:44Z","closed_at":"2025-09-04T19:38:38Z","author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anuragg-saxenaa/spring-boot-product-api/pulls/1","html_url":"https://github.com/anuragg-saxenaa/spring-boot-product-api/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/anuragg-saxenaa/spring-boot-product-api/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/anuragg-saxenaa/spring-boot-product-api/pull/1.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fix Kafka consumer configuration, Docker Compose Kafka listeners, and JPA entity `equals`/`hashCode` to prevent memory leaks and improve stability.\n\nThe Kafka consumer was misconfigured using `ProducerConfig` constants, leading to incorrect deserializer/group binding and potential resource churn. Docker Compose Kafka listeners only advertised `localhost:9092`, causing connection failures for in-cluster services and client retry storms. Additionally, the JPA `Product` entity's `equals`/`hashCode` generated by `@Data` used all fields, which can lead to memory retention in collections/caches and inconsistent identity semantics for unpersisted entities.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-fcebfa62-db0f-42ac-9b6e-7da8dff2a20d\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\">\n    <img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-fcebfa62-db0f-42ac-9b6e-7da8dff2a20d\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\">\n    <img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"anuragg-saxenaa","id":17893081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODkzMDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17893081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa","html_url":"https://github.com/anuragg-saxenaa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anuragg-saxenaa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.